DESCRIPTION:Remember to sign up: https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C0C48AAAF22A2F8C43-66346390-operation. Per Paul Copenhaver: the morning shift needs 1-2 more volunteers at Bi-Mart\; the afternoon's biggest need is Grocery Outlet. Kittitas County Rotary clubs' food drive for FISH.
